1. surface wind speed (zonal and meredional) are not available in the original nc output.
In addition, the default rsdsdir (direct SW radiation) output is at 3H frequency (we need 1H frequency).
They (uasm, vasm, rsdsdir) were converted from fa to nc manually by using script: extract_lowest_mlevel_to_nc_GreenWave.sh
Another problem with rsdsdir and rsds in the fa files is that the values at hour 00000 do not exist. 
This is solved by adding the values at hour 00001 to 00000 (nighttime, so both values should be 0) using the script ../fa2nc_multi_file/sel_value_GreenWave.sh. 

2. The model grid /nobackup/rossby24/users/sm_fuxwa/SURFEX_FORCING/HCLIM38_FORC/GreenWave/PGD_lfi.nc is converted from the lfi file 
/nobackup/smhid13/sm_isari/hm_home/GreenWave/GreenWave_HCLIM38_currentVmergedUrbSIS_NorCP_defaultPhys_ForSURFEXoffline/climate/PGD.lfi using script ../fa2nc/fa2nc_GreenWave.sh.

3. griddes_GreenWave_300m.txt.original is obtained by 'cdo griddes', but both # gridID 1 and # gridID 2 exist in this file (do not know why). So # gridID 1 has been removed and only # gridID 2 is kept in griddes_GreenWave_300m.txt. 

4. SURFEX_FORC/HCLIM38_Summer2018_STKHM_NEW/GreenWave_FORCING_screen_SCA_VARY_2018070100_2018080100.nc manually changed to 
SURFEX_FORC/HCLIM38_Summer2018_STKHM_NEW/GreenWave_FORCING_screen_SCA_VARY_2018070100_2018073124.nc (20180180100 -> 2018073124)

5. SCA_SW is not zero in AROME run, but it is zero in the script got from Patrick (used for WATCH data). 
SW_METHOD is set to SCA_VARY in GreenWave offline SURFEX forcing.

6. The PGD is very expensive when running with the new physiography. About 27-28 hours. PREP is faster (<1 hour) 
The OFFLINE is expensive too with the 300m grid (565*629), About 16-17 hours for one month simulation.
SURFEX73_GreenWave_300m_SCAY_ML_Summer2018_STKHM_NEW_defaultPhys_PGD_PREP (PGD and PREP step) -> SURFEX73_GreenWave_300m_SCAY_ML_Summer2018_STKHM_NEW_defaultPhys (OFFLINE step)
SURFEX73_GreenWave_300m_SCAY_ML_Summer2018_STKHM_NEW_PGD_PREP (PGD and PREP step) -> SURFEX73_GreenWave_300m_SCAY_ML_Summer2018_STKHM_NEW (OFFLINE step)

7. The variable related to UTCI (Town scheme) is is not in the default output.
Modifications are needed to have UTCI output (src/MYSRC_ncode_r18798_bugcorr_utci/init_outfn_tebn.F90).

8. If LSELECT = TRUE, variables in CSELECT will be in the output. 
   If LSELECT = FALSE, all variables will be in the output (CSELECT does not matter). 


9. The two runs (default and new physiography) use different input files for PGD/PREP. 
The files are got from the two parent HCLIM runs (with default and new physiography).

10. the convertion from fa to netcdf does not work for e.g., SFX.UTCI_IN, SFX.UTCI_OUTSUN, SFX.UTCI_OUTSHAD ... from HCLIM38 output file.
The error is:
$ gl_c38 -f -nc /nobackup/smhid13/sm_isari/hm_home/GreenWave/GreenWave_HCLIM38_currentVmergedUrbSIS_NorCP_Summer2018_STKHM_NEW_defaultPhys/archive/2018/07/01/00/ICMSHHARM+00744.sfx -n nam_utci
