Probably the resaon is that these variables are not included in the nc_tab.h file.
/nobackup/smhid13/sm_isari/hm_home/GreenWave/GreenWave_HCLIM38_currentVmergedUrbSIS_NorCP_Summer2018_STKHM_NEW_defaultPhys/lib/util/gl/inc/nc_tab.h
The T2M_TEB can be converted from fa to netcdf successfuly because this variable is in the nc_tab.h.
Not tested yet if the variables SFX.UTCI_IN ... are put in nc_tab.h.


 

